offset for next page should be current offset + limit, default is 0</p>
</dd><dt>sort</dt><dd><code>string</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>Sorting options: by_date, by_last_message (default by_date)</p>
</dd><dt>limit</dt><dd><code>string</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>Limit number of candidates, default is 100, max is 1000</p>
</dd><dt>query</dt><dd><code>string</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>Search query for candidate’s name or offer</p>
</dd><dt>offer_id</dt><dd><code>string</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>Filter by offer</p>
</dd><dt>disqualified</dt><dd><code>boolean</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>Show only disqualified candidates (should be string ‘true’ or ‘1’)</p>
</dd><dt>deleted</dt><dd><code>boolean</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>Show only deleted candidates (should be string ‘true’ or ‘1’)</p>
</dd><dt>ids</dt><dd><code>string</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>List of IDs separated by comma, example: 234221,4211412,535432</p>
</dd><dt>qualified</dt><dd><code>boolean</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>Show only qualified candidates (should be string ‘true’ or ‘1’)</p>
</dd><dt>created_after</dt><dd><code>string</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>Show only candidates created after given date</p>
</dd><dt>company_id</dt><dd><code>integer</code>&nbsp;<span class="required">(required)</span>&nbsp;<span class="text-muted example"><strong>Example:&nbsp;</strong><span>123</span></span><p>Company ID</p>
</dd></dl></div></div></div><hr class="split"><div class="middle"><div id="candidate.web.candidate-candidate.web.candidate-2" class="resource"><h3 class="resource-heading">Candidate.Web.Candidate <a href="#candidate.web.candidate-candidate.web.candidate-2" class="permalink">&para;</a></h3></div></div><div class="right"><div class="definition"><span class="method delete">DELETE</span>&nbsp;<span class="uri"><span class="hostname">https://api.recruitee.com</span>/c/<span class="hljs-attribute" title="company_id">123</span>/candidates/<span class="hljs-attribute" title="id">id</span></span></div><div class="tabs"><div class="example-names"><span>Requests</span><span class="tab-button">json</span></div><div class="tab"><div><div class="inner"><h5>Headers</h5><pre><code><span class="hljs-attribute">Content-Type</span>: <span class="hljs-string">application/json</span></code></pre><div style="height: 1px;"></div><h5>Body</h5><pre><code>{}</code></pre><div style="height: 1px;"></div></div></div><div class="tabs"><div class="example-names"><span>Responses</span><span class="tab-button">200</span></div><div class="tab"><div><div class="inner"><h5>Body</h5><pre><code>{
