</dd></dl></div></div></div><hr class="split"><div class="middle"><section id="gdpr.web.request" class="resource-group"><h2 class="group-heading">GDPR.Web.Request <a href="#gdpr.web.request" class="permalink">&para;</a></h2></section></div><div class="middle"><div id="gdpr.web.request-gdpr.web.request" class="resource"><h3 class="resource-heading">GDPR.Web.Request <a href="#gdpr.web.request-gdpr.web.request" class="permalink">&para;</a></h3></div></div><div class="right"><div class="definition"><span class="method get">GET</span>&nbsp;<span class="uri"><span class="hostname">https://api.recruitee.com</span>/c/<span class="hljs-attribute" title="company_id">123</span>/gdpr/candidates/<span class="hljs-attribute" title="candidate_id">candidate_id</span>/requests</span></div><div class="tabs"></div></div><div class="middle"><div id="gdpr.web.request-gdpr.web.request-get" class="action get"><h4 class="action-heading"><div class="name">List candidate's requests</div><a href="#gdpr.web.request-gdpr.web.request-get" class="method get">GET</a><code class="uri">/c/{company_id}/gdpr/candidates/{candidate_id}/requests</code></h4><div class="title"><strong>URI Parameters</strong><div class="collapse-button show"><span class="close">Hide</span><span class="open">Show</span></div></div><div class="collapse-content"><dl class="inner"><dt>candidate_id</dt><dd><code>integer</code>&nbsp;<span class="required">(required)</span>&nbsp;</dd><dt>company_id</dt><dd><code>integer</code>&nbsp;<span class="required">(required)</span>&nbsp;<span class="text-muted example"><strong>Example:&nbsp;</strong><span>123</span></span><p>Company ID</p>
