</dd><dt>status</dt><dd><code>string</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>Limit by event status, can be: ‘upcoming’, ‘past_due’, ‘all’(default ‘upcoming’)</p>
</dd><dt>limit</dt><dd><code>integer</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>Limit number of events, default is unlimited</p>
</dd><dt>candidate_id</dt><dd><code>integer</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>Candidate ID</p>
</dd><dt>timezone</dt><dd><code>string</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>Date range timezone, format: Europe/Amsterdam</p>
</dd><dt>admin_ids</dt><dd><code>array</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>Limits events to assigned to selected admins</p>
</dd><dt>start_date</dt><dd><code>string</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>Range start date, format: 2017-02-28</p>
</dd><dt>end_date</dt><dd><code>string</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>Range end date, format: 2017-02-28</p>
</dd><dt>page</dt><dd><code>integer</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>Page number used for pagination, can be used only with the limit option (1, 2, 3, 4…)</p>
</dd><dt>company_id</dt><dd><code>integer</code>&nbsp;<span class="required">(required)</span>&nbsp;<span class="text-muted example"><strong>Example:&nbsp;</strong><span>123</span></span><p>Company ID</p>
</dd></dl></div></div></div><hr class="split"><div class="middle"><div id="interview.web.event-interview.web.event-2" class="resource"><h3 class="resource-heading">Interview.Web.Event <a href="#interview.web.event-interview.web.event-2" class="permalink">&para;</a></h3></div></div><div class="right"><div class="definition"><span class="method delete">DELETE</span>&nbsp;<span class="uri"><span class="hostname">https://api.recruitee.com</span>/c/<span class="hljs-attribute" title="company_id">123</span>/interview/events/<span class="hljs-attribute" title="id">id</span></span></div><div class="tabs"><div class="example-names"><span>Requests</span><span class="tab-button">json</span></div><div class="tab"><div><div class="inner"><h5>Headers</h5><pre><code><span class="hljs-attribute">Content-Type</span>: <span class="hljs-string">application/json</span></code></pre><div style="height: 1px;"></div><h5>Body</h5><pre><code>{}</code></pre><div style="height: 1px;"></div></div></div><div class="tabs"><div class="example-names"><span>Responses</span><span class="tab-button">200</span></div><div class="tab"><div><div class="inner"><h5>Body</h5><pre><code>{
