</dd><dt>include</dt><dd><code>array</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>List of includes, available: ‘description’, ‘requirements’, ‘highlight’, ‘work_models’, ‘salary’, ‘dynamic_fields’, ‘follower_ids’, ‘location_ids’, ‘requisition_ids’, ‘tags’, ‘job_scheduler’, ‘issues’, ‘counters’</p>
</dd><dt>limit</dt><dd><code>integer</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>Limit number of results, default: 1000</p>
</dd><dt>kind</dt><dd><code>string</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>[DEPRECATED] If no kind is given list all job offers, if kind is ‘job’ than list only jobs, if scope is ‘talent_pool’ list only talent pools</p>
</dd><dt>statuses</dt><dd><code>array</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>List of offer statuses to filter by, available: ‘draft’, ‘published’, ‘internal’, ‘closed’, ‘archived’, if not given all offers will be listed</p>
</dd><dt>offer_ids</dt><dd><code>array</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>List of offer IDs to filter by, if not given all offers will be listed</p>
</dd><dt>location_ids</dt><dd><code>array</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>List of location IDs to filter by, if not given all offers will be listed</p>
</dd><dt>hiring_manager_ids</dt><dd><code>array</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>List of hiring manager IDs to filter by, if not given all offers will be listed</p>
</dd><dt>recruiter_ids</dt><dd><code>array</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>List of recruiter IDs to filter by, if not given all offers will be listed</p>
</dd><dt>lang_codes</dt><dd><code>array</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>List of lang codes to filter by, if not given all offers will be listed</p>
</dd><dt>categories</dt><dd><code>array</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>List of categories to filter by, if not given all offers will be listed</p>
</dd><dt>view_mode</dt><dd><code>string</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>[DEPRECATED] ‘default’ (default mode, includes most of offer details); ‘brief’ (only offer’s id, title, status and kind)</p>
</dd><dt>department_ids</dt><dd><code>array</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>List of department IDs to filter by, if not given all offers will be listed</p>
</dd><dt>page</dt><dd><code>integer</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>Page number (1, 2, 3, …), default: 1</p>
</dd><dt>educations</dt><dd><code>array</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>List of educations to filter by, if not given all offers will be listed</p>
</dd><dt>priorities</dt><dd><code>array</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>List of priorities to filter by, available: <code>urgent</code>, <code>high</code>, <code>normal</code>, <code>low</code>, if not given all offers will be listed</p>
</dd><dt>employment_types</dt><dd><code>array</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>List of employment types to filter by, if not given all offers will be listed</p>
</dd><dt>experiences</dt><dd><code>array</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>List of experiences to filter by, if not given all offers will be listed</p>
</dd><dt>tag_ids</dt><dd><code>array</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>List of tag IDs to filter by, if not given all offers will be listed</p>
</dd><dt>company_id</dt><dd><code>integer</code>&nbsp;<span class="required">(required)</span>&nbsp;<span class="text-muted example"><strong>Example:&nbsp;</strong><span>123</span></span><p>Company ID</p>
</dd></dl></div></div></div><hr class="split"><div class="middle"><div id="offer.web.offer-offer.web.offer-2" class="resource"><h3 class="resource-heading">Offer.Web.Offer <a href="#offer.web.offer-offer.web.offer-2" class="permalink">&para;</a></h3></div></div><div class="right"><div class="definition"><span class="method delete">DELETE</span>&nbsp;<span class="uri"><span class="hostname">https://api.recruitee.com</span>/c/<span class="hljs-attribute" title="company_id">123</span>/offers/<span class="hljs-attribute" title="id">id</span></span></div><div class="tabs"><div class="example-names"><span>Requests</span><span class="tab-button">json</span></div><div class="tab"><div><div class="inner"><h5>Headers</h5><pre><code><span class="hljs-attribute">Content-Type</span>: <span class="hljs-string">application/json</span></code></pre><div style="height: 1px;"></div><h5>Body</h5><pre><code>{}</code></pre><div style="height: 1px;"></div></div></div><div class="tabs"><div class="example-names"><span>Responses</span><span class="tab-button">200</span></div><div class="tab"><div><div class="inner"><h5>Body</h5><pre><code>{
