<div class="title"><strong>URI Parameters</strong><div class="collapse-button show"><span class="close">Hide</span><span class="open">Show</span></div></div><div class="collapse-content"><dl class="inner"><dt>limit</dt><dd><code>integer</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>Page size (default: 20, max: 1000)</p>
</dd><dt>sort_by</dt><dd><code>string</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>Sort by</p>
</dd><dt>offer_id</dt><dd><code>integer</code>&nbsp;<span class="required">(required)</span>&nbsp;<p>Offer ID or slug</p>
</dd><dt>stage_id</dt><dd><code>integer</code>&nbsp;<span class="required">(required)</span>&nbsp;<p>Stage ID</p>
</dd><dt>disqualified</dt><dd><code>boolean</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>Disqualified</p>
</dd><dt>sort_order</dt><dd><code>string</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>Sort order (asc or desc)</p>
</dd><dt>page</dt><dd><code>integer</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>Page number (default: 1)</p>
</dd><dt>qualified</dt><dd><code>boolean</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>Qualified</p>
</dd><dt>with_created_at</dt><dd><code>boolean</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>Return creation date (default: true)</p>
</dd><dt>with_evaluations</dt><dd><code>boolean</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>Return positive rating and evaluation requests (default: true)</p>
</dd><dt>with_last_activity_at</dt><dd><code>boolean</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>Return last activity date (default: false)</p>
</dd><dt>with_locations</dt><dd><code>boolean</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>Return assigned location_ids (default: true)</p>
</dd><dt>with_my_pending_result_requests</dt><dd><code>boolean</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>Return per-placement my_pending_result_requests {total, pending} — the viewer’s own evaluation requests for the candidate on this offer (default: false)</p>
</dd><dt>with_notes_count</dt><dd><code>boolean</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>Return notes count (default: true)</p>
</dd><dt>with_overdue_at</dt><dd><code>boolean</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>Return overdue date (default: true)</p>
</dd><dt>with_pending_result_requests</dt><dd><code>boolean</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>Return per-placement pending_result_requests {total, pending} for the candidate on this offer. Requires the manage_candidate ability, otherwise the field is omitted (default: false)</p>
</dd><dt>with_skill_evaluation</dt><dd><code>boolean</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>Return skills_count, matching_skills_count and skills_visible (default: false)</p>
</dd><dt>with_social_links</dt><dd><code>boolean</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>Return social links (default: false)</p>
</dd><dt>with_tags</dt><dd><code>boolean</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>Return tags (default: false)</p>
</dd><dt>with_tasks_count</dt><dd><code>boolean</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>Return tasks count (default: true)</p>
</dd><dt>with_upcoming_events</dt><dd><code>boolean</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>Return upcoming event (default: true)</p>
</dd><dt>with_ai_screening</dt><dd><code>boolean</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>Return AI screening object (default: false)</p>
</dd><dt>with_job_fit_score</dt><dd><code>boolean</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>Return job fit score / positive_ratings (default: true)</p>
</dd><dt>company_id</dt><dd><code>integer</code>&nbsp;<span class="required">(required)</span>&nbsp;<span class="text-muted example"><strong>Example:&nbsp;</strong><span>123</span></span><p>Company ID</p>
</dd></dl></div></div></div><hr class="split"><div class="middle"><div id="pipeline.web.placement-pipeline.web.placement-3" class="resource"><h3 class="resource-heading">Pipeline.Web.Placement <a href="#pipeline.web.placement-pipeline.web.placement-3" class="permalink">&para;</a></h3></div></div><div class="right"><div class="definition"><span class="method post">POST</span>&nbsp;<span class="uri"><span class="hostname">https://api.recruitee.com</span>/c/<span class="hljs-attribute" title="company_id">123</span>/placements</span></div><div class="tabs"><div class="example-names"><span>Requests</span><span class="tab-button">json</span></div><div class="tab"><div><div class="inner"><h5>Headers</h5><pre><code><span class="hljs-attribute">Content-Type</span>: <span class="hljs-string">application/json</span></code></pre><div style="height: 1px;"></div><h5>Body</h5><pre><code>{}</code></pre><div style="height: 1px;"></div></div></div><div class="tabs"><div class="example-names"><span>Responses</span><span class="tab-button">201</span></div><div class="tab"><div><div class="inner"><h5>Body</h5><pre><code>{
  "<span class="hljs-attribute">references</span>": <span class="hljs-value">[
    {
