<div class="title"><strong>URI Parameters</strong><div class="collapse-button show"><span class="close">Hide</span><span class="open">Show</span></div></div><div class="collapse-content"><dl class="inner"><dt>id</dt><dd><code>integer</code>&nbsp;<span class="required">(required)</span>&nbsp;<p>Placement ID</p>
</dd><dt>position</dt><dd><code>integer</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>Destination slot: the upper neighbour’s current position (the board renders position descending); <code>1</code> for the bottom. Required unless <code>proceed</code> is set.</p>
</dd><dt>proceed</dt><dd><code>boolean</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>Move to the top of the column (alternative to <code>position</code>)</p>
</dd><dt>company_id</dt><dd><code>integer</code>&nbsp;<span class="required">(required)</span>&nbsp;<span class="text-muted example"><strong>Example:&nbsp;</strong><span>123</span></span><p>Company ID</p>
