</dd><dt>position</dt><dd><code>integer</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>Destination slot for a cross-stage drop: the upper neighbour’s current position (the board renders position descending). Wins over <code>proceed</code>. Omit and send <code>proceed</code> for top of column; send <code>1</code> for bottom. (optional)</p>
</dd><dt>proceed</dt><dd><code>boolean</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>Placement will be placed at the top of the stage placements list if <code>true</code> (optional)</p>
</dd><dt>hired_at</dt><dd><code>datetime</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>When candidate was hired in the job (optional)</p>
</dd><dt>work_location_id</dt><dd><code>integer</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>Location ID (required when marking a candidate as hired)</p>
</dd><dt>opening_id</dt><dd><code>integer</code>&nbsp;<span class="required">(required)</span>&nbsp;<p>Opening ID (required when requisitions are enabled and marking a candidate as hired)</p>
</dd><dt>stage_id</dt><dd><code>integer</code>&nbsp;<span class="required">(required)</span>&nbsp;<p>Stage ID (change to stage sourced if ‘sourced’)</p>
</dd><dt>job_starts_at</dt><dd><code>datetime</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>When candidate starts the job (optional)</p>
</dd><dt>disqualify_reason_id</dt><dd><code>boolean</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>Disqualify other placements if the param exists. Set the disqualify reason (optional)</p>
</dd><dt>run_actions</dt><dd><code>boolean</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>Automated actions should be triggered if <code>true</code> (optional)</p>
</dd><dt>remove_from_sharing_containers</dt><dd><code>boolean</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>Remove from all public links (sharing containers) if it’s <code>true</code> (optional)</p>
</dd><dt>disqualify_run_actions</dt><dd><code>boolean</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>Run automated actions for the disqualified placements if it’s <code>true</code> (optional)</p>
</dd><dt>company_id</dt><dd><code>integer</code>&nbsp;<span class="required">(required)</span>&nbsp;<span class="text-muted example"><strong>Example:&nbsp;</strong><span>123</span></span><p>Company ID</p>
</dd></dl></div></div></div><hr class="split"><div class="middle"><div id="pipeline.web.placement-pipeline.web.placement-7" class="resource"><h3 class="resource-heading">Pipeline.Web.Placement <a href="#pipeline.web.placement-pipeline.web.placement-7" class="permalink">&para;</a></h3></div></div><div class="right"><div class="definition"><span class="method patch">PATCH</span>&nbsp;<span class="uri"><span class="hostname">https://api.recruitee.com</span>/c/<span class="hljs-attribute" title="company_id">123</span>/placements/<span class="hljs-attribute" title="id">id</span>/disqualify</span></div><div class="tabs"><div class="example-names"><span>Requests</span><span class="tab-button">json</span></div><div class="tab"><div><div class="inner"><h5>Headers</h5><pre><code><span class="hljs-attribute">Content-Type</span>: <span class="hljs-string">application/json</span></code></pre><div style="height: 1px;"></div><h5>Body</h5><pre><code>{}</code></pre><div style="height: 1px;"></div></div></div><div class="tabs"><div class="example-names"><span>Responses</span><span class="tab-button">200</span></div><div class="tab"><div><div class="inner"><h5>Body</h5><pre><code>{
