</dd><dt>q</dt><dd><code>string</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>Search by: external user name, candidate name, offer title, reward name</p>
</dd><dt>limit</dt><dd><code>integer</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>Limit number of results, default: 1000</p>
</dd><dt>sort_by</dt><dd><code>string</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>One of: [referrer_name, candidate_name, offer_title, reward_name, referred_at], default: referred_at desc;</p>
