</dd><dt>local_id</dt><dd><code>string</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>Additional identifier.</p>
</dd><dt>metric</dt><dd><code>string</code>&nbsp;<span class="required">(required)</span>&nbsp;<p>Metric type.</p>
</dd><dt>template_id</dt><dd><code>string</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>Id of the template the component was created with.</p>
</dd><dt>primary_group</dt><dd><code>string</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>Attribute used to aggregate results.</p>
</dd><dt>secondary_group</dt><dd><code>string</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>Attribute used for additional, secondary grouping of the results.</p>
</dd><dt>sort_order</dt><dd><code>string</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>Sort order. Can be: asc, desc (default: desc).</p>
</dd><dt>view_mode</dt><dd><code>string</code>&nbsp;<span class="required">(required)</span>&nbsp;<p>Visualization type. Can be: chart, table, summary.</p>
