</dd><dt>status</dt><dd><code>string</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>Limits tasks to ‘completed’ or ‘uncompleted’</p>
</dd><dt>limit</dt><dd><code>integer</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>Limit of items per page</p>
</dd><dt>sort_by</dt><dd><code>string</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>Order tasks by, ‘due_date’, ‘created_at’, ‘completed_at’</p>
</dd><dt>admin_ids</dt><dd><code>array</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>Limits tasks to assigned to selected admins</p>
</dd><dt>sort_order</dt><dd><code>string</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>Order tasks by ‘asc’ or ‘desc’</p>
</dd><dt>page</dt><dd><code>integer</code>&nbsp;<span>(optional)</span>&nbsp;<p>Page number</p>
</dd><dt>company_id</dt><dd><code>integer</code>&nbsp;<span class="required">(required)</span>&nbsp;<span class="text-muted example"><strong>Example:&nbsp;</strong><span>123</span></span><p>Company ID</p>
